WEBVTT

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.040
I am a Soil missionary, Moogle, kupo!

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:17.970
I'll come along with you guys, kupo!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.420
For the sake of Teros...

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.680
Comodeen!

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:26.720
For the sake of order...

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.890
Comodeen!

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.090
For the sake of Teros...

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:33.230
Comodeen!

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:35.300
For the sake of order...

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.530
Comodeen!

00:00:37.530 --> 00:00:39.630
For the sake of Teros...

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.730
Comodeen!

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.210
For the sake of order...

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.230
Comodeen!

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:46.610
Comodeen kupo!

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:48.610
For the sake of Teros...

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.980
Comodeen!

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:55.450
Come on, Cid, isn't this enough?
Let's get the engine running already!

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:56.890
I can't!

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:00.250
This area of the ocean has a super high
concentration of Elenium!

00:01:00.820 --> 00:01:02.460
If I were to start the engine,

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:04.720
the Elenium would instantly explode
in a chemical reaction.

00:01:05.230 --> 00:01:07.190
It would blow Jane to smithereens!

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:11.430
I could never let that happen
to my beloved Jane.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.860
There is no other option than to
power Jane manually for now.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.000
Could this also be one of the Earl's traps?

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.880
Thanks for waiting!

00:01:30.820 --> 00:01:33.980
We're just about to enter an area of the sea
that has a low concentration of Elenium.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:36.280
Just a little further...

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.060
What?

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.230
There's no more ocean!

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:18.260
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:18.260
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:25.770
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:25.770
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:34.880
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:34.880
With our eyes on the future

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:40.980
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:40.980
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:50.620
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:50.620
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:58.130
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:58.130
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.840
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:00.040 --> 00:03:03.840
Fly to the Neverland

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:13.340
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:13.340
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.830
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:31.270
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:36.240
Searching for the miraculous Flying Water,

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:39.270
our wandering travelers
continue their adventure,

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.880
along with their new friend, Moogle.

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:50.550
And they are quite close
to their final destination...

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.430
Oh! My Jane!

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.970
Oh, man!

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.630
No one expected the ocean to just end like that.

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.910
Is someone here, kupo?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.920
Over here!

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:19.410
Look up here!

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:21.650
It's me, Lou!

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:23.180
Lou!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.220
Lou is flying?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:29.460
That's not the legendary Ciel Lou
or something, is it?

00:04:30.060 --> 00:04:31.590
Long time no see, guys!

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:37.600
Hey, you know, I haven't been able
to find Mr. Kaze at all.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:39.700
That guy...

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:41.110
He's over there.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.810
Mr. Kaze!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:49.020
Let me go! Let go of me!

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:51.250
Hey, isn't this cape made from Flying Water?

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.820
Flying Water?

00:04:52.820 --> 00:04:55.690
Where did you get this?
Did you meet Clear or something?

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:58.190
Clear? I don't know anyone like that.

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:00.160
Mr. Bolbol might know.

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:02.920
Mr. Bolbol?

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:12.730
I'm home!

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:16.040
Hey, Lou, welcome home.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.240
Mr. Bolbol, these people are my friends.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:22.340
Really? Welcome.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:26.220
Hello...

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:30.780
Mr. Bolbol here uses Flying Water
to make all kinds of clothes.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.960
I used to work part-time here.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:34.480
Why did you have a job?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.430
I was thinking I wanted to fly
to make it easier to look for Mr. Kaze.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.660
So I helped out at the store here for a while

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.860
and asked him to sell me a cape for real cheap.

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:51.310
Have Lisa and Mr. Kaze been getting
any closer to each other?

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:54.020
No way, not at all.

00:05:54.020 --> 00:05:56.450
All right! Thank you, Lisa!

00:05:58.450 --> 00:05:59.920
Mr. Kaze!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.290
I'm so happy to hear that
you haven't been unfaithful.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.130
Kupo...

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.050
Mr. Kaze!

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.270
Do you make all of this stuff with Flying Water?

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:18.670
They're all hand-made. One of a kind.

00:06:18.670 --> 00:06:19.940
Even the Flying Water cape?

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.240
Of course!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:26.780
The price is one billion fifty million gil.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.280
One billion?!

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.340
One billion fifty million Gil!

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.820
So expensive!

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:33.750
That's what makes me Mr. Bolbol!

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.180
I don't know the exchange rate.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:40.460
For example, Knave's cigars cost
about three gil apiece.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.230
I agree with you guys then.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:46.000
I forgot, the glove.

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:55.080
It's the same. This is the same as what
Clear was wearing.

00:06:55.680 --> 00:06:58.840
So Mr. Bolbol, does that mean that
you've met Clear?

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.580
Oh, that name really takes me back.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:06.020
So you do know him!
I want to give this glove back to him.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.650
I know he's missing it.

00:07:08.890 --> 00:07:12.920
Yeah, this is definitely one I made.

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:17.500
Clear looked a lot like my first love!

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:20.630
That's why I gave him the
Flying Water clothes for free.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:25.060
You just gave it to him?! So can you
give something to us too?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.940
I don't think so. You're not quite cute enough.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.840
I met Clear in Teros.

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.440
Teros? You know about Teros?

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:38.550
Of course I know about Teros,
it lies in the middle of this forest.

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.980
Is this Teros?

00:07:52.500 --> 00:07:54.370
This stuff is as hard as ice.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.330
Sis!

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:58.970
You guys...

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:01.370
What is this?

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.910
This is Flying Water, I'm sure of it!

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.400
We've finally arrived at Teros!

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:12.020
It's really fun to fly in the sky, kupo!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:17.180
Clear was suppressing his Omega power
with the Flying Water.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:20.420
He was here so that his power
could not be used.

00:08:21.030 --> 00:08:22.520
Clear, where are you?

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:27.360
Finally, the day when Silvia will be able
to fly the big, blue sky is approaching!

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:31.100
Now we can raid the Earl's castle, Gaudium!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:36.210
The Comodeen will soon be victorious!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.710
Hey there, your excitement's gone down, kupo.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.760
Yu, what's wrong?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.450
Nothing.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:56.120
I'm just thinking that it's been a long trip
to get here to Teros.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:15.040
Open up, Your Excellency.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:16.410
I don't want it.

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.860
What's been up with you lately?

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:22.450
You haven't really been eating much.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.350
I'm not hungry.

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.590
The truth is that this is a very good thing.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:31.060
If His Excellency is satisfied,
that means Wonderland is at peace.

00:09:31.330 --> 00:09:34.530
I'm sure that Chaos is feeling very happy too.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.500
This is all thanks to Lord Pist's Ocean Puzzle.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:52.050
It is complete!

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.660
After years of research into Soil and the Magun,

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.660
I have discovered the ultimate weapon
against the Magun,

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.750
Blue Elenium!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.990
Please allow me to introduce these guys!

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:09.270
The power machines that I have prepared
for this day to collect the Flying Water!

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.040
L'Amant, cars one through ten!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:19.580
This is their big debut!

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.320
These chain energy pedals are used
both to move the vehicles

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:25.920
and also to generate power.

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:28.360
The faster you pedal these transport
L'Amant power machines,

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.720
the more their power increases,
up to one hundred times!

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.000
And what's more, even with a large amount
of Flying Water crystals on board,

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.730
they are still guaranteed to be highly mobile!

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.660
Is that supposed to be amazing, kupo?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:43.230
I can't wait to see the Silvia
flying machine in the sky.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:45.000
Yeah.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.810
Chobi...

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.410
Thanks, Chobi.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.150
Okay then, hurry up and
collect that Flying Water!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.410
Mr. Kaze, you're such a good listener.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.660
You know, when I'm around
people of my species,

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:08.800
all I have to do is stare into their eyes
and then I can turn into a werewolf.

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.390
I don't need a mirror or anything.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:15.500
<i>When I change forms, I look into
my own eyes in a mirror.</i>

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.230
<i>On my world, staring into someone's
eyes is proof of trust.</i>

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:23.510
<i>If there is faith, then energy
is formed through this staring.</i>

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:24.570
<i>Isn't it awesome?!</i>

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:33.320
It would be nice if someday, I could
transform after staring into your eyes.

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:43.220
My L'Amant car number three!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.260
Hang in there!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.190
What happened?!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.940
Hi! Welcome to Teros!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:01.570
I am your guide to the Ocean Puzzle,
Pist Sharws the 11th!

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.090
So, ladies and gentlemen, we meet again!

00:12:12.490 --> 00:12:13.790
One of the Earl's henchmen!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:15.700
I really can't be having you do this.

00:12:15.700 --> 00:12:18.030
Were you really planning on escaping
the Ocean Puzzle?

00:12:18.030 --> 00:12:20.300
The game is not yet over, you know.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:22.060
Prepare to attack!

00:12:24.210 --> 00:12:26.400
Blue Elenium!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.730
Fire!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.210
Blue Elenium?!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:36.980
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:40.220
I cannot allow you to
ever escape the Ocean Puzzle!

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.150
You bastard!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.090
Let's see how you do with this!

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.450
It's useless!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.360
Miles! Are you okay?!

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:06.310
You scoundrel!

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:09.040
Cid?!

00:13:09.580 --> 00:13:14.650
Taste the fear and pain
that my L'Amants suffered!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.030
Ultimate Hammer!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.360
He's using it!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.770
What are you doing?

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:47.020
You did it!

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:55.160
I got him for you, L'Amant
#2, #3, #5, #6, #7, #9, #10...

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.070
No way!

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.100
That's too bad.

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:11.940
You're the one who's going to be
feeling fear and pain!

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:14.470
Cid, hang in there!

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:21.120
Go ahead and try to smash someone like me
who's made of liquid!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:22.550
Go ahead and try!

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:24.550
I'll do it!

00:14:31.730 --> 00:14:32.600
Lou!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:33.890
Is everyone all right?

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:35.890
What did you do for a mirror?

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.670
Mr. Bolbol gave this to me.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:43.540
I brought Mr. Kaze with me too!

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:45.680
Kaze!

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:47.440
You came!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:49.440
Great timing, partner!

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:53.320
Oh, the Black Wind!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:14:58.420
It has moved.

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:01.750
Soil is my power!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.390
The Magun has thawed!

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:37.830
I've been waiting for this.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.200
Now, come on and shoot me! Shoot me!

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.470
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.600
The origin of all things,
Mother Black!

00:15:56.980 --> 00:16:00.650
A heat that will scorch all things,
Fire Red!

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:09.360
And finally, the critical point of
everything, Burning Gold!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:21.430
Here we go, partner! Power up, kupo!

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:28.510
Burn! I summon you, Giga Phoenix!

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:48.030
I've been waiting for this!
Blue Elenium!

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.200
His Summon has...

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.080
This isn't good. The Soil from the
Phoenix that I upgraded

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.180
to the Giga Phoenix has been corroded!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:09.320
That's right! Blue Elenium consumes Soil!

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:13.190
So you see, I own the Summons!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.060
It got him.

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:26.810
It appears that somehow things are
going better than I had suspected.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:31.140
The Summon will continue to destroy
until it runs out of energy.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.440
Until all of the Flying Water evaporates!

00:17:38.650 --> 00:17:40.710
My business is ruined!

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:45.460
Soil...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:49.060
Without Flying Water, our escape
will be very difficult.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:53.100
We could possibly end up wandering
in the Ocean Puzzle forever.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.120
What did you say?!

00:17:59.370 --> 00:18:00.310
It didn't work!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:11.380
Well, well.

00:18:11.550 --> 00:18:12.650
Lou!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:13.620
Are you okay?

00:18:15.890 --> 00:18:18.230
I'm fine, I'm still alive.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.790
What I'm really worried about is what
I heard from the Summon.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.130
I could hear the Soil shrieking because
of his suffering under the Blue Elenium!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.430
Shrieking?

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.430
Take care of Lou, okay?

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:28.500
Lisa?!

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:33.430
<i>Spirit of overflowing water...</i>

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.940
<i>Transform my life into spiritual energy.</i>

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:57.220
Oh, I've finished analyzing his data too!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:06.800
Lisa!

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.410
Lisa, wake up!

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:13.180
Lisa! Hang in there!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:16.040
You have to look for you boyfriend, right?!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.570
Hey, Lisa, come on!

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:21.520
Ocean Puzzle and Chaos!

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:24.620
Take their fear and impatience and
transform it into your own power!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.290
Pist!

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:32.330
Makenshi! What have you come here to do?!

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:42.170
Listen to the eternal instrumental duo.

00:19:43.080 --> 00:19:44.410
Now sleep!

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:50.510
Duet of the Arctic Night!

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.630
What is this?!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.270
Black Wind...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.540
White Cloud...

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:22.980
Impressive as ever.

00:20:28.390 --> 00:20:30.790
The appropriate Soil to use against
you has been decided!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Hitomi tojite yowasete

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Only the two of us are being taken

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.000
Futari dake wo tsurete ku

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
On this trip that we began with nothing but love

00:20:58.050 --> 00:21:02.250
Ai dake tsurete tabidatsu

